{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 423.396,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, I will show unto you",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.456,
      "end": 5.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they did not establish a king over the land;",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.84,
      "end": 7.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in this same year,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 7.645,
      "end": 9.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the thirtieth year,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 9.265,
      "end": 11.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did destroy upon the judgment-seat,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 11.999,
      "end": 14.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, did murder the chief judge of the land.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 14.955,
      "end": 17.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people were divided one against another;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 18.014,
      "end": 21.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did separate one from another into tribes,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 21.677,
      "end": 26.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to his family and his kindred and friends;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 26.826,
      "end": 30.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they did destroy the government of the land.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.757,
      "end": 34.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And every tribe did appoint a chief or a leader over them;",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.652,
      "end": 38.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they became tribes and leaders of tribes.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 38.861,
      "end": 41.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, there was no man among them",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 41.549,
      "end": 45.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save he had much family and many kindreds and friends;",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.351,
      "end": 48.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore their tribes became exceedingly great.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.957,
      "end": 50.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now all this was done,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 50.67,
      "end": 53.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were no wars as yet among them;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.544,
      "end": 56.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all this iniquity had come upon the people",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 57.021,
      "end": 60.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they did yield themselves unto the power of Satan.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.37,
      "end": 72.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the regulations of the government were destroyed, because of the secret combination of the friends and kindreds of those who murdered the prophets.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 72.731,
      "end": 75.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did cause a great contention in the land,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.79,
      "end": 80.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the more righteous part of the people had nearly all become wicked;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 80.893,
      "end": 83.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, there were but few righteous men among them.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.499,
      "end": 86.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus six years had not passed away",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.047,
      "end": 91.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "since the more part of the people had turned from their righteousness,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 91.221,
      "end": 93.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like the dog to his vomit,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 93.351,
      "end": 96.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or like the sow to her wallowing in the mire.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 96.725,
      "end": 98.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this secret combination,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.995,
      "end": 102.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had brought so great iniquity upon the people,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 102.751,
      "end": 104.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did gather themselves together,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 105.16,
      "end": 108.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did place at their head a man whom they did call Jacob;",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.555,
      "end": 112.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did call him their king;",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 112.196,
      "end": 115.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he became a king over this wicked band;",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.58,
      "end": 117.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was one of the chiefest",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 117.478,
      "end": 122.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had given his voice against the prophets who testified of Jesus.",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 123.266,
      "end": 126.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were not so strong in number",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 127.022,
      "end": 130.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as the tribes of the people, who were united together",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 130.453,
      "end": 133.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were their leaders did establish their laws,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 133.977,
      "end": 136.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every one according to his tribe;",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 136.386,
      "end": 138.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they were enemies;",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 138.656,
      "end": 141.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding they were not a righteous people,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 141.53,
      "end": 144.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they were united in the hatred of those",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 144.868,
      "end": 148.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had entered into a covenant to destroy the government.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 149.217,
      "end": 154.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, Jacob seeing that their enemies were more numerous than they,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 154.227,
      "end": 156.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being the king of the band,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 156.404,
      "end": 163.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he commanded his people that they should take their flight into the northernmost part of the land,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 163.55,
      "end": 166.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there build up unto themselves a kingdom,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 166.795,
      "end": 169.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they were joined by dissenters,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 169.622,
      "end": 173.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for he flattered them that there would be many dissenters)",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 173.471,
      "end": 179.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they become sufficiently strong to contend with the tribes of the people; and they did so.",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 180.049,
      "end": 183.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And so speedy was their march that it could not be impeded",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 183.898,
      "end": 187.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had gone forth out of the reach of the people.",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 187.329,
      "end": 189.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the thirtieth year;",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 189.506,
      "end": 192.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus were the affairs of the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 193.158,
      "end": 196.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the thirty and first year",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 196.682,
      "end": 199.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were divided into tribes,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 199.184,
      "end": 203.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to his family, kindred and friends;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 203.358,
      "end": 206.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they had come to an agreement",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 206.324,
      "end": 209.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would not go to war one with another;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 209.337,
      "end": 212.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they were not united as to their laws,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 212.303,
      "end": 214.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their manner of government,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 214.48,
      "end": 221.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were established according to the minds of those who were their chiefs and their leaders.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 221.905,
      "end": 224.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they did establish very strict laws",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.5,
      "end": 227.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that one tribe should not trespass against another,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 227.931,
      "end": 231.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that in some degree they had peace in the land;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 231.966,
      "end": 235.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, their hearts were turned from the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 235.768,
      "end": 240.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did stone the prophets and did cast them out from among them.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 240.72,
      "end": 242.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Nephi\u2014",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 243.176,
      "end": 246.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having been visited by angels and also the voice of the Lord,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 247.071,
      "end": 250.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore having seen angels, and being eye-witness,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 250.548,
      "end": 253.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having had power given unto him",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 253.282,
      "end": 256.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might know concerning the ministry of Christ,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 256.527,
      "end": 263.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also being eye-witness to their quick return from righteousness unto their wickedness and abominations;",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 264.452,
      "end": 267.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, being grieved for the hardness of their hearts",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 267.883,
      "end": 269.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the blindness of their minds\u2014",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 269.967,
      "end": 272.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "went forth among them in that same year,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 272.794,
      "end": 274.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to testify, boldly,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 275.064,
      "end": 279.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repentance and remission of sins through faith on the Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 279.924,
      "end": 282.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did minister many things unto them;",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 282.798,
      "end": 284.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all of them cannot be written,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 284.975,
      "end": 287.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a part of them would not suffice,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 287.384,
      "end": 289.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they are not written in this book.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 290.118,
      "end": 293.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Nephi did minister with power and with great authority.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 294.188,
      "end": 296.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were angry with him,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 297.154,
      "end": 299.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even because he had greater power than they,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 299.981,
      "end": 303.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it were not possible that they could disbelieve his words,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 303.783,
      "end": 307.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for so great was his faith on the Lord Jesus Christ",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 307.214,
      "end": 309.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that angels did minister unto him daily.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 310.355,
      "end": 315.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the name of Jesus did he cast out devils and unclean spirits;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 315.318,
      "end": 318.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even his brother did he raise from the dead,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 318.238,
      "end": 322.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after he had been stoned and suffered death by the people.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 322.68,
      "end": 325.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people saw it, and did witness of it,",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 325.925,
      "end": 328.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were angry with him because of his power;",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 328.473,
      "end": 333.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did also do many more miracles, in the sight of the people, in the name of Jesus.",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 334.354,
      "end": 338.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the thirty and first year did pass away,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 338.621,
      "end": 342.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were but few who were converted unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 342.284,
      "end": 346.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but as many as were converted did truly signify unto the people",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 346.597,
      "end": 350.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had been visited by the power and Spirit of God,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 350.26,
      "end": 353.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in Jesus Christ, in whom they believed.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 353.726,
      "end": 356.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as many as had devils cast out from them,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 356.971,
      "end": 360.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were healed of their sicknesses and their infirmities,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 360.588,
      "end": 364.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did truly manifest unto the people that they had been wrought",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 364.483,
      "end": 367.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon by the Spirit of God, and had been healed;",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 368.053,
      "end": 372.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did show forth signs also and did do some miracles among the people.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 373.284,
      "end": 376.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus passed away the thirty and second year also.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 376.854,
      "end": 381.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Nephi did cry unto the people in the commencement of the thirty and third year;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 381.957,
      "end": 385.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did preach unto them repentance and remission of sins.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 386.538,
      "end": 392.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I would have you to remember also, that there were none who were brought unto repentance",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 392.291,
      "end": 394.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were not baptized with water.",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 395.386,
      "end": 399.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, there were ordained of Nephi, men unto this ministry,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 399.931,
      "end": 404.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all such as should come unto them should be baptized with water,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 404.291,
      "end": 407.681,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this as a witness and a testimony before God,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 407.861,
      "end": 409.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto the people,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 409.481,
      "end": 413.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had repented and received a remission of their sins.",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 414.108,
      "end": 417.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were many in the commencement of this year",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 417.214,
      "end": 419.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that were baptized unto repentance;",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 419.809,
      "end": 422.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the more part of the year did pass away.",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    }
  ]
}